{
	quest.104D25730471C208.quest_desc: [
		"Iron and amethyst. The only tool you need."
		""
		"§eClick a pipe end§r to switch it between §5Output§r (purple plate) and §6Input§r (gold plate, pulls from the block). Sneak-click an end to disconnect that side, and sneak-click a pipe's core to take that one strand out. Wrenches from other mods work too."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reaper Wrench and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.104D25730471C208.title: "Reaper Wrench"
	quest.10805BABEB01ECAD.quest_desc: [
		"Empty-hand right-click an §6Input§r end to open its screen: a speed card slot, a 9-slot filter, redstone control and how it shares items out (Round-robin, Nearest first or Random)."
		""
		"Right-click an §5Output§r end to set its priority and its own filter. Higher priority fills first."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 2 x Hopper and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.10805BABEB01ECAD.title: "Input and Output Ends"
	quest.10E515CB77F13718.quest_desc: [
		"Paper, amethyst and a glow ink sac. Sneak-click an end to copy its settings, then click other ends to paste them. Speed cards stay put. Great for big sorting walls."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reaper Imprint and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.10E515CB77F13718.title: "Reaper Imprint"
	quest.112744859E5087D1.quest_desc: [
		"A full Soulforged Omni line: items, fluids, power and chemicals through one clean pipe at top speed, with zero lag."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 16 x Reaper Omni Pipe and 4 x Soulforged Pipe Upgrade and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.112744859E5087D1.title: "Grim Pipe Master"
	quest.1185BACA85DC1797.quest_desc: [
		"Item, Fluid and Energy Pipes around an ender pearl. One pipe that moves all four kinds: items, fluids, energy and chemicals."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 4 x Reaper Omni Pipe and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1185BACA85DC1797.title: "Reaper Omni Pipe"
	quest.119C51A28D6DF438.quest_desc: [
		"Nine Craft's own pipe mod, made by §dxTri6§r. Small, black-and-purple, lag-free pipes for items, fluids, energy and Mekanism chemicals, built to match Grim Soul Industries."
		""
		"§eThe idea:§r place a pipe, flip the end that should pull to §6Input§r with the Reaper Wrench, and you're done. Speed comes from one card in the Input end, never from the pipes in between."
		""
		"Every pipe is polished deepslate and amethyst, so dig up some deepslate to start."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 32 x Cobbled Deepslate and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.119C51A28D6DF438.title: "§5Grim Pipe Industries"
	quest.1287D35F7921B7B3.quest_desc: [
		"Gold, amethyst and redstone. Put it in an §6Input§r end: 32 items a second instead of 8, and 8,000 FE a tick instead of 1,000. One card speeds up the whole line."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Whispering Pipe Upgrade and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1287D35F7921B7B3.title: "Whispering Pipe Upgrade"
	quest.12A91DAEE72A540A.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click a placed pipe with a different kind of pipe and both share that one block. Each strand connects to the same face of a machine on its own, so one face can take items, fluids and power at once."
		""
		"Sneak-click an empty-handed pipe to see every end in that block on one screen."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 4 x Reaper Item Pipe, 4 x Reaper Fluid Pipe and 4 x Reaper Energy Pipe and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.12A91DAEE72A540A.title: "Bundle Them Up"
	quest.147134F4E3D9D601.quest_desc: [
		"Amethyst, ender pearls and an echo shard (or a Reaper's Lantern if you have Grim Soul Industries). Click one pipe, then another anywhere in the same dimension, and their networks join with no pipe in between. Both ends must be loaded."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Soul Link and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.147134F4E3D9D601.title: "Soul Link"
	quest.14DEEA21925D4CE5.quest_desc: [
		"A Restless card with crying obsidian and ender pearls. 640 items a second and 512,000 FE a tick."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Wraithbound Pipe Upgrade and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.14DEEA21925D4CE5.title: "Wraithbound Pipe Upgrade"
	quest.14ED0356DCD1A4D0.quest_desc: [
		"Paper, amethyst and redstone. Put it in any filter slot and type rules: §e#c:ingots§r for a tag, §e@mekanism§r for a whole mod, or §e*_log§r with a wildcard. It shows what matches as you type."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reaper Tag Filter and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.14ED0356DCD1A4D0.title: "Reaper Tag Filter"
	quest.177E23A10974CB39.quest_desc: [
		"The same recipe with a bucket in the middle. Moves any fluid from any tank."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make 8 x Reaper Fluid Pipe and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.177E23A10974CB39.title: "Reaper Fluid Pipe"
	quest.1CCB37735217149B.quest_desc: [
		"A book and an Item Pipe make a 10-page guide that teaches the whole mod in-game."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Reaper Field Guide and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.1CCB37735217149B.title: "Reaper Field Guide"
